  ConfigurationRefusal.[ Invalid
                         StaleRevision
                         NotAuthorized.Caller
                         Unavailable ]
  MetaCall.{ Caller Query }
  MetaTransportInput.[ Call.MetaCall RestoreTranslatorConfiguration ]
  MetaTransportOutput.[ Answered.Response
